Scheme/configuration matrix
Scheme                    Configuration  Entitlements file                   Compilation condition  Result
NotchFlow (App Store)     AppStore       NotchFlow-AppStore.entitlements    APPSTORE_BUILD          PASS
NotchFlow (App Store)     Direct         NotchFlow-Direct.entitlements      DIRECT_BUILD            PASS
NotchFlow (Direct)        AppStore       NotchFlow-AppStore.entitlements    APPSTORE_BUILD          PASS
NotchFlow (Direct)        Direct         NotchFlow-Direct.entitlements      DIRECT_BUILD            PASS

All four combinations were built with explicit -scheme and -configuration,
CODE_SIGN_IDENTITY=-, and isolated DerivedData paths. Every xcodebuild exited 0.
The two schemes are pinned to AppStore and Direct respectively for normal
launch, test, profile, analyze, and archive actions. Explicit command-line
-configuration overrides were used only to prove no scheme/config mixture can
change the configuration-owned entitlements or compilation condition.

